{"step_index":60,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T14:33:22Z","input_tokens":2743,"cache_read_tokens":91254,"output_tokens":827,"thinking":"The location service file needs to be created. Examining the referenced document's section two provides specific accuracy thresholds that dictate user interaction and data flagging. Based on the accuracy level, either a normal, nudge, or manual pin placement will be required. Mock locations are allowed but flagged.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import 'package:geolocator/geolocator.dart';\nimport '../core/constants.dart';\n\nclass LocationReading {\n  final double latitude;\n  final double longitude;\n  final double accuracyMeters;\n  final bool isMocked;\n  final bool isLowAccuracy;\n  final bool isVeryLowAccuracy;\n\n  LocationReading({\n    required this.latitude,\n    required this.longitude,\n    required this.accuracyMeters,\n    required this.isMocked,\n    required this.isLowAccuracy,\n    required this.isVeryLowAccuracy,\n  });\n}\n\n/// Precise Location Service with Quality Assessment\n/// Specification: RULES.pdf §2.1 - §2.3, TRD.pdf §7\nclass LocationService {\n  /// Request GPS location and assess accuracy\n  static Future<LocationReading> getCurrentReading() async {\n    bool serviceEnabled = await Geolocator.isLocationServiceEnabled();\n    if (!serviceEnabled) {\n      // Default to Agra pilot center coordinate with low accuracy flag if disabled\n      return LocationReading(\n        latitude: 27.1767,\n        longitude: 78.0081,\n        accuracyMeters: 120.0,\n        isMocked: false,\n        isLowAccuracy: true,\n        isVeryLowAccuracy: true,\n      );\n    }\n\n    LocationPermission permission = await Geolocator.checkPermission();\n    if (permission == LocationPermission.denied) {\n      permission = await Geolocator.requestPermission();\n    }\n\n    if (permission == LocationPermission.denied || permission == LocationPermission.deniedForever) {\n      return LocationReading(\n        latitude: 27.1767,\n        longitude: 78.0081,\n        accuracyMeters: 150.0,\n        isMocked: false,\n        isLowAccuracy: true,\n        isVeryLowAccuracy: true,\n      );\n    }\n\n    // Capture location with 10s timeout (TRD.pdf §7)\n    final position = await Geolocator.getCurrentPosition(\n      locationSettings: const LocationSettings(\n        accuracy: LocationAccuracy.high,\n        timeLimit: Duration(seconds: 10),\n      ),\n    );\n\n    final acc = position.accuracy;\n    return LocationReading(\n      latitude: position.latitude,\n      longitude: position.longitude,\n      accuracyMeters: acc,\n      isMocked: position.isMocked,\n      isLowAccuracy: acc > AppConstants.gpsGoodMaxMeters,\n      isVeryLowAccuracy: acc > AppConstants.gpsWeakMaxMeters,\n    );\n  }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\ashmi\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\civicsync\\apps\\citizen_app\\lib\\services\\location_service.dart"}}]}
