{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T14:36:30Z","input_tokens":8447,"cache_read_tokens":101694,"output_tokens":566,"thinking":"Building the machine learning pipeline involves defining outputs and leveraging prior municipal dashboard functionality. The project documentation suggests three key documents provide specifications for this pipeline. The number of output classes is defined as five which include potholes, open drains and broken roads.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"tensorflow>=2.15.0\nkeras>=3.0.0\nnumpy>=1.26.0\nalbumentations>=1.4.0\nscikit-learn>=1.4.0\nopencv-python>=4.9.0\npillow>=10.2.0\nmatplotlib>=3.8.0\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\ashmi\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\civicsync\\ml\\requirements.txt"}}]}
